event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"## 1\n\n"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"Oh no, I am so sorry it’s been this awful! 💛 I completely understand reaching the end of your rope and just"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" wanting to be free of it, but please don't do anything impulsive while your stress levels are through the roof. Can"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" I bring over some dinner tonight or treat you to coffee so we can vent it all out? Let’s talk through"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" an exit plan together so you can leave on your own terms with a safety net in place!\n\n## 2\n\nThat’"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"s definitely one of the more creative rabbit holes out there! But while I can appreciate a lively imagination, the science behind"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" our spinning, spherical Earth is rock-solid—and honestly, even more wondrous than any conspiracy. From ships dipping hull"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"-first over the horizon to the curved shadow our planet casts during a lunar eclipse, humans have actually known we live on a globe for thousands"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" of years, well before modern space photography came along! \n\n## 3\n\nThink of sunlight like a team of colors"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" traveling together in waves. Red and orange light travel in long, lazy, slow waves, while blue light travels in short"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":", energetic, choppy little waves! \n\nWhen sunlight hits Earth’s atmosphere, it runs into billions of tiny gas molecules."}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" The long red and yellow waves pass right through them without much trouble, but those tiny, bouncy blue waves bump into the"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" air particles and scatter in every single direction—kind of like a handful of superballs bouncing off the walls of a room. When you"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" look up during the day, you’re seeing all that scattered blue light bouncing right into your eyes!\n\n## 4\n\n夜"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"幕低垂，细密的雨丝斜斜地织入黑暗，在昏黄的路灯下泛着柔"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"和的微光。雨滴轻快地敲打着窗玻璃，宛如大自然悄悄弹奏的一曲舒缓"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"小夜曲。街道上行人寥寥，湿漉漉的柏油路面映出斑斓倒影"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"，像是一幅被水汽晕染开的水彩画。屋里弥漫着淡淡的书香与热"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"茶的暖意，听着窗外淅淅沥沥的声响，整个喧嚣的世界仿佛都在这场"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"夜雨中渐渐沉静下来。\n\n## 5\n\nHi Sarah,\n\nThanks so much for organizing this! I already have prior"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" plans lined up for Friday evening, so I won't be able to join the team for drinks this time around. \n\nI"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" hope you all have a wonderful evening and a fantastic start to the weekend—I'll catch up with everyone on Monday!\n\nWarm"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"ly,  \nAria\n\n## 6\n\nI would describe my writing style as warm, cheerful, and clear"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":", blending an encouraging, friendly voice with thoughtful clarity to keep things both helpful and uplifting."}}

